.TH "CSSTRANSFORMVALUE.IS2D" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSTransformValue.is2D \- CSSTransformValue: is2D property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]is2D\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]CSSTransformValue\f[R] interface returns whether the transform is
2D or 3D.
.PP
In the case of the \f[CR]CSSTransformValue\f[R], this property returns
true unless any of the individual functions return false for
\f[CR]Is2D\f[R], in which case, it returns false.
.SH VALUE
A boolean.
True indicates that the transform is a 2D transform, false that it is a
3D transform.
